for it.

00:00:23.039 --> 00:00:26.119
Zero Republican senators voted for it.

00:00:26.119 --> 00:00:28.650
Zero Republican members of the House voted
for it.

00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:33.930
People got covid cash, Republicans, Democrats,
independents, apolitical people.

00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:35.870
People got covid cash
Speaker 3: only

00:00:35.870 --> 00:00:38.240
