payments from the federal government during

00:01:36.259 --> 00:01:37.539
the pandemic.

00:01:37.539 --> 00:01:40.549
Two were under Donald Trump, one was under
Democrats.

00:01:40.549 --> 00:01:46.479
The first two under Trump's administration
had huge Democratic support.

00:01:46.479 --> 00:01:51.819
And it was thanks to Republicans and Democrats
that people got those first two bills.

00:01:51.819 --> 00:01:58.520
But the third one under Joe Biden's watch
was only because of Democrats Rural Objective

00:01:58.520 --> 00:01:59.680
PAC.

00:01:59.680 --> 00:02:05.179
This is a super PAC that is working to build
Democratic support in rural or rural.

00:02:05.179 --> 00:02:13.700
As some say areas found that 50 percent of
voters in rural areas associated the recent

00:02:13.700 --> 00:02:17.879
