00:03:37.329 --> 00:03:42.400
I mean, there is a group in this country that
just has no idea what's going on around them.

00:03:42.400 --> 00:03:43.431
There's no other way to say it.

00:03:43.431 --> 00:03:45.459
These are not matters of opinion.

00:03:45.459 --> 00:03:47.900
There are you know, we've talked before.

00:03:47.900 --> 00:03:51.040
There are people who like the Affordable Care
