00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:55.969
And there are people who are skeptical of
Obamacare, but would be OK expanding the Affordable

00:03:55.969 --> 00:03:56.969
Care Act.

00:03:56.969 --> 00:03:57.969
And of course, it's the same thing.

00:03:57.969 --> 00:03:58.969
They don't.

00:03:58.969 --> 00:04:00.090
It's the same thing.

00:04:00.090 --> 00:04:07.540
This is not the we are not talking about an
