00:04:52.470 --> 00:04:54.510
Fox News is misinforming them.

00:04:54.510 --> 00:04:55.720
Republicans are misinforming them.

00:04:55.720 --> 00:04:56.960
Trump misinformed them.

00:04:56.960 --> 00:05:02.950
