00:05:02.950 --> 00:05:06.180
There's not really any clear way to get them
out of the right wing bubble.

00:05:06.180 --> 00:05:08.590
They watch right wing TV, they listen to right
wing radio.

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:13.210
They go on Facebook and see things shared
by people who have the exact same beliefs.

00:05:13.210 --> 00:05:15.479
They go to their church and often get a lot
